WEBVTT

00:01:34.704 --> 00:01:37.737
You boys really screwed up this time.

00:01:41.438 --> 00:01:42.770
Where is he?

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:46.770
You're never gonna
see your father again.

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:52.371
They've got dad.

00:01:52.404 --> 00:01:53.737
Meg?

00:01:54.971 --> 00:01:56.137
What did she say?

00:01:56.171 --> 00:01:57.870
I just told you, sammy.

00:01:59.237 --> 00:02:03.670
Okay.

00:02:08.637 --> 00:02:10.770
What are you doing, dean?

00:02:10.804 --> 00:02:12.971
We got to go.

00:02:13.004 --> 00:02:14.971
Why?

00:02:15.004 --> 00:02:17.137
Because the demon knows
we're in salvation.

00:02:17.171 --> 00:02:18.770
It knows we've got the colt.

00:02:18.804 --> 00:02:20.438
It's probably coming for us next.

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:22.603
We've still got three bullets left.

00:02:22.637 --> 00:02:24.404
Listen, tough guy, we're not ready.

00:02:24.438 --> 00:02:26.603
We don't know how many
of them are out there.

00:02:26.637 --> 00:02:28.770
We're no good to anybody dead.

00:02:28.804 --> 00:02:31.371
We're leaving...now.

00:02:38.603 --> 00:02:42.503
I'm telling you, dean,
we could've taken him.

00:02:42.537 --> 00:02:43.971
What we need is a plan.

00:02:44.004 --> 00:02:46.503
They're keeping dad alive.
We've got to figure out where.

00:02:46.537 --> 00:02:49.171
They're gonna want to
trade him for the gun.

00:02:49.204 --> 00:02:51.470
What?

00:02:51.503 --> 00:02:54.271
If that were true, why
didn't meg mention a trade?

00:02:56.338 --> 00:02:59.371
Dad, he might be -

00:02:59.404 --> 00:03:01.537
I don't want to believe
it any more than you,

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:05.338
But if he is, all the more
reason to kill this damn thing.

00:03:05.371 --> 00:03:07.804
We still have the colt. We
can still finish the job.

00:03:07.837 --> 00:03:09.004
Screw the job, sam!

00:03:09.037 --> 00:03:11.171
Dean, i'm just trying
to do what he would want.

00:03:11.204 --> 00:03:15.004
Would you quit talking about
him like he's dead already?

00:03:15.037 --> 00:03:16.171
Listen to me.

00:03:16.204 --> 00:03:18.670
Everything stops until we get him back.

00:03:18.704 --> 00:03:20.004
Everything.

00:03:23.904 --> 00:03:25.204
So, how do we find him?

00:03:25.237 --> 00:03:26.537
Maybe we go to lincoln.

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:28.804
Start at the warehouse
where he was taken.

00:03:28.837 --> 00:03:31.237
You really think these demons
are gonna leave a trail?

00:03:31.271 --> 00:03:33.438
You're right.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.971
We need help.

00:04:02.737 --> 00:04:04.737
Here you go.

00:04:06.804 --> 00:04:08.438
What is this
- Holy water?

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.804
That one is. This is whiskey.

00:04:16.804 --> 00:04:20.071
Bobby, thanks. Thanks for everything.

00:04:20.104 --> 00:04:22.570
To tell you the truth, i
wasn't sure if we should come.

00:04:22.603 --> 00:04:24.404
Nonsense. Your daddy needs help.

00:04:24.438 --> 00:04:25.603
The last time we saw you,

00:04:25.637 --> 00:04:27.804
You did threaten to blast
him full of buckshot.

00:04:27.837 --> 00:04:29.637
You cocked the shotgun and everything.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:32.470
Yeah, well, what can i say?

00:04:32.503 --> 00:04:34.537
John just has that effect on people.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:37.104
Yeah, i guess he does.

00:04:37.137 --> 00:04:38.438
None of that matters now.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.104
All that matters is
that you get him back.

00:04:41.137 --> 00:04:43.271
Bobby, this book.

00:04:43.304 --> 00:04:45.603
I've never seen anything like it.

00:04:45.637 --> 00:04:50.271
Key of solomon? It's
the real deal, all right.

00:04:50.304 --> 00:04:53.470
And these protective circles
- They really work?

00:04:53.503 --> 00:04:54.537
Hell yeah.

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:58.104
You get a demon in one, they're trapped.

00:04:58.137 --> 00:05:02.071
They're powerless. It's
like a satanic roach motel.

00:05:02.104 --> 00:05:03.570
Dean: the man knows his stuff.

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:07.570
I'll tell you something else, too.

00:05:07.603 --> 00:05:11.071
This is some serious
crap you boys stepped in.

00:05:11.104 --> 00:05:14.570
Oh, yeah? How's that?

00:05:14.603 --> 00:05:18.770
Normal year, i hear, say,
three demonic possessions,

00:05:18.804 --> 00:05:20.804
Maybe four, tops.

00:05:20.837 --> 00:05:24.237
This year, i heard of 27 so far.

00:05:24.271 --> 00:05:25.804
You get what i'm saying?

00:05:25.837 --> 00:05:30.637
More and more demons are walking among us
- A lot more.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:33.537
Do you know why?

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:35.870
No, but i know it's something big.

00:05:35.904 --> 00:05:41.037
The storm's coming, and
you boys, your daddy -

00:05:41.071 --> 00:05:43.470
You are smack in the middle of it.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:50.304
Rumsfeld.

00:05:50.338 --> 00:05:51.670
What is it?

00:05:56.404 --> 00:05:58.404
Something's wrong.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:06.004
No more crap, okay?

00:06:14.837 --> 00:06:19.804
I want the colt,
sam - The real colt -

00:06:19.837 --> 00:06:23.304
Right now.

00:06:23.338 --> 00:06:25.704
We don't have it on us. We buried it.

00:06:25.737 --> 00:06:27.237
Didn't i say "no more crap"?

00:06:27.271 --> 00:06:30.371
I swear
- After everything i heard about you winchesters,

00:06:30.404 --> 00:06:33.804
I've got to tell you,
i'm a little underwhelmed.

00:06:33.837 --> 00:06:37.004
First johnny tries to
pawn off a fake gun,

00:06:37.037 --> 00:06:40.870
And then he leaves the real
gun with you two chuckleheads.

00:06:40.904 --> 00:06:42.404
Lackluster, men.

00:06:42.438 --> 00:06:48.603
I mean, did you really
think i wouldn't find you?

00:06:52.104 --> 00:06:55.937
Actually, we were counting on it.

00:07:09.404 --> 00:07:11.503
Gotcha.

00:07:25.438 --> 00:07:30.237
You know, if you wanted to tie me up,

00:07:30.271 --> 00:07:32.438
All you had to do was ask.

00:07:35.603 --> 00:07:37.737
I salted the doors and windows.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:40.770
If there are any demons out
there, they ain't getting in.

00:07:48.371 --> 00:07:50.171
Where's our father, meg?

00:07:50.204 --> 00:07:52.937
You didn't ask very nice.

00:07:52.971 --> 00:07:54.503
Where's our father, bitch?

00:07:54.537 --> 00:07:58.670
Jeez. You kiss your
mother with that mouth?

00:07:58.704 --> 00:08:01.438
Oh, i forgot. You don't.

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:03.737
You think this is a freaking game?!

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:05.637
Where is he?! What did you do to him?!

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:10.137
He died screaming. I killed him myself.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:24.670
That's kind of a turn-On
- You hitting a girl.

00:08:24.704 --> 00:08:26.304
You're no girl.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.904
Dean.

00:08:31.503 --> 00:08:33.470
You okay?

00:08:33.503 --> 00:08:34.870
She's lying. He's not dead.

00:08:34.904 --> 00:08:37.438
Dean, you've got to be careful
with her. Don't hurt her.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:39.171
Why?

00:08:39.204 --> 00:08:41.037
Because she really
is a girl. That's why.

00:08:41.071 --> 00:08:42.438
What are you talking about?

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:43.603
She's possessed.

00:08:43.637 --> 00:08:45.603
That's a human possessed by a demon.

00:08:45.637 --> 00:08:47.603
Can't you tell?

00:08:47.637 --> 00:08:50.438
Are you trying to tell me
there's an innocent girl

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:53.171
Trapped somewhere in there?

00:08:59.704 --> 00:09:02.037
That's actually good news.

00:09:14.171 --> 00:09:16.304
Are you gonna read me a story?

00:09:16.338 --> 00:09:20.037
Something like that. Hit it, sam.

00:09:20.071 --> 00:09:26.237
<i>"Regna terrae, cantTe
deo, psLlite dMino..."</i>

00:09:26.271 --> 00:09:30.404
An exorcism? Are you serious?

00:09:30.438 --> 00:09:32.271
We're going for it, baby
- Head spinning,

00:09:32.304 --> 00:09:34.904
Projectile vomiting,
the whole nine yards.

00:09:34.937 --> 00:09:37.470
<i>"Tribuite virtutem deo."</i>

00:09:44.104 --> 00:09:47.737
I'm gonna kill you.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:51.071
I'm gonna rip the bones from your body.

00:09:51.104 --> 00:09:53.237
No, you're gonna burn in hell

00:09:53.271 --> 00:09:55.237
Unless you tell us where our dad is.

00:09:57.537 --> 00:10:01.271
Well, at least you'll get a nice tan.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:07.937
<i>"Exorcizamus te, omnis
immundus spiritus,</i>

00:10:07.971 --> 00:10:11.204
<i>"Omnis satanica potestas,</i>

00:10:11.237 --> 00:10:14.071
<i>"Omnis incursio infernalis
adversarii, omnis legio,</i>

00:10:14.104 --> 00:10:17.071
<i>"Omnis congregatio et secta diabolica."</i>

00:10:17.104 --> 00:10:18.404
Aah!

00:10:19.404 --> 00:10:24.537
He begged for his life
with tears in his eyes.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:28.404
He begged to see his sons one last time.

00:10:28.438 --> 00:10:30.204
That's when i slit his throat.

00:10:35.937 --> 00:10:36.904
<i>"Ergo..."</i>

00:10:36.937 --> 00:10:41.071
For your sake, i hope you're lying.

00:10:41.104 --> 00:10:43.304
'Cause if it's true, i swear to god,

00:10:43.338 --> 00:10:45.271
I will march into hell myself,

00:10:45.304 --> 00:10:47.704
And i will slaughter each and every one

00:10:47.737 --> 00:10:50.404
Of you evil sons of
bitches, so help me god.

00:10:50.438 --> 00:10:53.104
<i>"Perditionis venenum propinare.</i>

00:10:53.137 --> 00:10:59.937
<i>"Vade, satana, inventor et
magister omnis fallaciae,</i>

00:10:59.971 --> 00:11:02.770
<i>"Hostis humanae salutis.</i>

00:11:02.804 --> 00:11:06.271
<i>"Humiliare sub potenti manu
dei, contremisce et effuge,</i>

00:11:06.304 --> 00:11:10.004
<i>"Invocato a nobis sancto
et terribili nomine,</i>

00:11:10.037 --> 00:11:12.104
<i>Quem inferi tremunt."</i>

00:11:12.137 --> 00:11:13.603
Aah!

00:11:13.637 --> 00:11:14.971
Where is he?

00:11:16.837 --> 00:11:19.137
You just won't take "dead"
for an answer, will you?

00:11:19.171 --> 00:11:20.971
Where is he?!

00:11:21.004 --> 00:11:22.637
Dead! No, he's not!

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:24.570
He's not dead! He can't be!

00:11:28.037 --> 00:11:30.004
What are you looking at? Keep reading.

00:11:30.037 --> 00:11:33.171
<i>"Ab insidiis diaboli,
libera nos, domine.</i>

00:11:33.204 --> 00:11:38.704
<i>"Ut ecclesiam tuam secura
tibi facias libertate servire,</i>

00:11:38.737 --> 00:11:41.338
<i>Te rogamus, audi nos."</i>

00:11:41.371 --> 00:11:44.171
Aaaah!

00:11:44.204 --> 00:11:48.503
<i>"Ut inimicos sanctae
ecclesiae humiliare digneris,</i>

00:11:48.537 --> 00:11:50.304
<i>Te rogamus audi
-"</i>

00:11:50.338 --> 00:11:51.470
He will be!

00:11:51.503 --> 00:11:52.470
Wait! What?!

00:11:52.503 --> 00:11:54.037
He's not dead,

00:11:54.071 --> 00:11:57.304
But he will be after what we do to him.

00:11:58.904 --> 00:12:01.470
How do we know you're telling the truth?

00:12:01.503 --> 00:12:02.704
You don't.

00:12:02.737 --> 00:12:04.204
Sam! A building!

00:12:04.237 --> 00:12:06.971
Okay? A building in jefferson city.

00:12:07.004 --> 00:12:09.737
Missouri? Where, where? An address.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:10.870
I don't know.

00:12:10.904 --> 00:12:12.503
And the demon
- Where is it?

00:12:12.537 --> 00:12:14.204
I don't know. I swear.

00:12:15.904 --> 00:12:18.904
That's everything. That's all i know.

00:12:23.304 --> 00:12:24.570
Finish it.

00:12:24.603 --> 00:12:26.404
What? I told you the truth.

00:12:26.438 --> 00:12:27.904
I don't care.

00:12:27.937 --> 00:12:29.404
You son of a bitch. You promised.

00:12:29.438 --> 00:12:31.737
I lied!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.603
Sam?

00:12:35.737 --> 00:12:37.570
Sam!

00:12:39.371 --> 00:12:41.171
Read.

00:12:41.204 --> 00:12:44.004
We can still use her, find
out where the demon is.

00:12:44.037 --> 00:12:45.338
She doesn't know.

00:12:45.371 --> 00:12:48.037
There's an innocent girl
trapped somewhere in there.

00:12:48.071 --> 00:12:49.637
We've got to help her.

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:51.271
You're gonna kill her.

00:12:51.304 --> 00:12:52.438
What?

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:56.037
You said she fell from a building.

00:12:57.737 --> 00:13:00.237
That girl's body is broken.

00:13:00.271 --> 00:13:03.870
The only thing keeping her
alive is that demon inside.

00:13:03.904 --> 00:13:07.071
You exorcise it, the girl is gonna die.

00:13:07.104 --> 00:13:09.137
We are not gonna leave her like that.

00:13:09.171 --> 00:13:10.304
She is a human being.

00:13:10.338 --> 00:13:13.204
And we're gonna put
her out of her misery.

00:13:13.237 --> 00:13:15.704
Sam, finish it.

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:27.304
Finish it.

00:13:34.271 --> 00:13:38.904
<i>"Dominicos sanctae ecclesiae.</i>

00:13:38.937 --> 00:13:40.570
<i>"Terogamus audi nos.</i>

00:13:40.603 --> 00:13:44.404
<i>"Terribilis deus de
sanctuario suo deus israhel</i>

00:13:44.438 --> 00:13:48.570
<i>"Ipse tribuite virtutem
et fortitudinem plebi suae.</i>

00:13:48.603 --> 00:13:51.271
<i>Benedictus deus. Gloria patri."</i>

00:14:27.004 --> 00:14:28.470
Dean: she's still alive.

00:14:28.503 --> 00:14:31.603
Call 911. Get some water and blankets.

00:14:34.704 --> 00:14:37.503
Thank you.

00:14:37.537 --> 00:14:40.171
Shh, shh, just take it easy, all right?

00:14:40.204 --> 00:14:41.371
Thank you.

00:14:41.404 --> 00:14:42.470
Shh.

00:14:42.503 --> 00:14:44.204
Come on. Let's get her down.

00:14:46.404 --> 00:14:49.870
Sorry, sorry.

00:14:49.904 --> 00:14:52.570
I've got you. I've got you.

00:14:52.603 --> 00:14:54.503
It's okay. It's okay.

00:14:54.537 --> 00:14:58.338
A year.

00:14:58.371 --> 00:14:59.870
What?

00:14:59.904 --> 00:15:01.870
It's been a year.

00:15:01.904 --> 00:15:04.171
Just take it easy.

00:15:04.204 --> 00:15:08.004
I've been awake for some of it.

00:15:11.637 --> 00:15:14.304
I couldn't move my own body.

00:15:15.904 --> 00:15:21.037
The things i did
- It's a nightmare.

00:15:21.071 --> 00:15:23.704
Was it telling us the
truth about our dad?

00:15:23.737 --> 00:15:25.537
Dean.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:26.770
We need to know.

00:15:26.804 --> 00:15:28.371
Yes.

00:15:30.104 --> 00:15:36.271
But it wants... you to know

00:15:36.304 --> 00:15:40.204
That...they want you to come for him.

00:15:40.237 --> 00:15:43.171
If dad's still alive,
none of that matters.

00:15:54.637 --> 00:15:56.637
Where is the demon we're looking for?

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:58.470
Not there.

00:15:58.503 --> 00:16:02.637
Other ones.

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.204
Awful ones.

00:16:05.338 --> 00:16:07.304
Where are they keeping our dad?

00:16:07.338 --> 00:16:11.904
By the r-River.

00:16:15.603 --> 00:16:17.937
Sunrise.

00:16:17.971 --> 00:16:20.271
"Sunrise"? What does that mean?

00:16:22.371 --> 00:16:24.704
What does that mean?

00:16:58.757 --> 00:16:59.357
You better hurry up and beat it

00:17:00.124 --> 00:17:01.791
Before the paramedics get here.

00:17:01.824 --> 00:17:03.323
What are you gonna tell them?

00:17:03.357 --> 00:17:06.323
You think you guys
invented lying to the cops?

00:17:06.357 --> 00:17:08.957
I'll figure something out.

00:17:08.991 --> 00:17:12.290
Here. Take this. You might need it.

00:17:12.323 --> 00:17:14.091
Thanks.

00:17:15.323 --> 00:17:18.557
Thanks...for everything.

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:20.024
Be careful, all right?

00:17:20.058 --> 00:17:21.490
Just go find your dad.

00:17:21.524 --> 00:17:24.757
And when you do, you bring
him around, would you?

00:17:24.791 --> 00:17:27.091
I won't even try to shoot him this time.

00:17:59.957 --> 00:18:01.957
You've been quiet.

00:18:03.891 --> 00:18:06.058
Just getting ready.

00:18:09.424 --> 00:18:12.424
He's gonna be fine, dean.

00:18:31.390 --> 00:18:33.857
Dude, what are you drawing on my car?

00:18:33.891 --> 00:18:36.857
It's called a devil's trap.

00:18:36.891 --> 00:18:39.190
Demons can't get
through it or inside it.

00:18:39.223 --> 00:18:40.557
So?

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:43.924
It basically turns the
trunk into a lockbox.

00:18:45.924 --> 00:18:47.724
So?

00:18:47.757 --> 00:18:50.724
So we have a place to hide
the colt while we go get dad.

00:18:50.757 --> 00:18:53.557
What are you talking about?
We're bringing the colt with us.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:54.891
We can't, dean.

00:18:54.924 --> 00:18:56.657
We've only got three bullets left.

00:18:56.691 --> 00:18:58.524
We can't just use them on any demon.

00:18:58.557 --> 00:19:00.190
<i>We've got to use them on the demon.</i>

00:19:00.223 --> 00:19:02.323
No, we have to save dad, sam, okay?

00:19:02.357 --> 00:19:04.757
We're gonna need all
the help we can get.

00:19:04.791 --> 00:19:07.357
You know how pissed dad would
be if we used all the bullets?

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:09.524
Dean, he wouldn't want
us to bring the gun.

00:19:09.557 --> 00:19:10.924
I don't care, sam!

00:19:10.957 --> 00:19:12.524
I don't care what dad wants, okay?

00:19:12.557 --> 00:19:14.357
Since when do you care what dad wants?

00:19:14.390 --> 00:19:17.058
We want to kill this demon.
You used to want that, too.

00:19:17.091 --> 00:19:19.557
Hell, you're the one who
came and got me at school!

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.390
You're the one who dragged me into this.

00:19:21.424 --> 00:19:23.158
I'm just trying to finish it.

00:19:28.424 --> 00:19:31.091
Well, you and dad are a lot
more alike than i thought.

00:19:31.124 --> 00:19:33.757
You both can't wait to sacrifice
yourself for this thing.

00:19:33.791 --> 00:19:36.691
But you know what? I'm
gonna be the one to bury you.

00:19:41.058 --> 00:19:42.524
You're selfish, you know that?

00:19:42.557 --> 00:19:44.857
You don't care about
anything but revenge.

00:19:44.891 --> 00:19:46.857
That's not true, dean.

00:19:46.891 --> 00:19:48.824
I want dad back,

00:19:48.857 --> 00:19:50.991
But they are expecting
us to bring this gun.

00:19:51.024 --> 00:19:53.323
They get the gun, they will kill us all.

00:19:53.357 --> 00:19:56.158
That colt is our only
leverage, and you know it, dean.

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:59.757
We cannot bring that gun. We can't.

00:19:59.791 --> 00:20:01.624
Fine.

00:20:01.657 --> 00:20:04.223
I'm serious, dean. I said "fine," sam.

00:20:34.323 --> 00:20:36.624
Hey, hey.

00:20:36.657 --> 00:20:41.490
I think i know what
meg meant by "sunrise."

00:20:51.024 --> 00:20:54.457
Son of a bitch. That's pretty smart.

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:56.290
If these demons can possess people,

00:20:56.323 --> 00:20:58.457
They can possess almost anybody inside.

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:00.957
And make anybody attack us.

00:21:00.991 --> 00:21:02.290
And so we can't kill 'em -

00:21:02.323 --> 00:21:04.691
A building full of human shields.

00:21:04.724 --> 00:21:07.490
They probably know exactly
what we look like, too,

00:21:07.524 --> 00:21:09.457
And they could look like anybody.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:11.158
This sucks out loud.

00:21:11.190 --> 00:21:16.257
All right, so, how the
hell are we gonna get in?

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:22.024
Pull the fire alarm, get
out all the civilians.

00:21:22.058 --> 00:21:24.024
But then the city
responds in seven minutes.

00:21:24.058 --> 00:21:26.124
Seven minutes, exactly.

00:22:27.991 --> 00:22:29.457
You okay?

00:22:34.691 --> 00:22:36.323
Hey, what's happening? Is it a fire?

00:22:36.357 --> 00:22:38.158
We're figuring that out right now, sir.

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:39.657
Just stay back.

00:22:39.691 --> 00:22:42.158
I got a yorkie upstairs, and
he pees when he's nervous.

00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:45.924
Sir, you have to stay back.

00:23:05.490 --> 00:23:08.158
I always wanted to be a
fireman when i grew up.

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:10.323
You never told me that.

00:23:34.257 --> 00:23:37.757
This is the fire department.
We need you to evacuate.

00:24:07.190 --> 00:24:08.590
Hurry up!

00:24:43.757 --> 00:24:45.158
Dad.

00:24:52.158 --> 00:24:54.390
He's still breathing.

00:24:54.424 --> 00:24:56.590
Dad, wake up.

00:24:56.624 --> 00:24:57.891
Dad!

00:25:01.158 --> 00:25:02.457
Wait. Wait.

00:25:02.490 --> 00:25:03.624
What?

00:25:03.657 --> 00:25:05.691
He could be possessed, for all we know.

00:25:05.724 --> 00:25:08.457
What, are you nuts?

00:25:08.490 --> 00:25:10.257
Dean, we got to be sure.

00:25:31.957 --> 00:25:34.624
Sam?

00:25:37.290 --> 00:25:40.124
Why are you splashing water on me?

00:25:41.857 --> 00:25:44.557
Dad, are you okay?

00:25:44.590 --> 00:25:48.091
They've been drugging me.

00:25:48.124 --> 00:25:49.757
Where's the colt?

00:25:49.791 --> 00:25:52.624
Don't worry, dad, it's safe.

00:25:54.223 --> 00:25:57.824
Good, boys. Good, boys.

00:26:17.323 --> 00:26:18.791
Hey, buddy, you can't go in.

00:26:32.557 --> 00:26:33.524
Go!

00:26:33.557 --> 00:26:34.524
Back, back!

00:26:34.557 --> 00:26:36.557
Go!

00:26:43.204 --> 00:26:45.737
Sam, let's go!

00:27:03.838 --> 00:27:05.671
Sam!

00:27:39.537 --> 00:27:41.170
Sam!

00:27:41.204 --> 00:27:44.437
Sam, come on. Come on.

00:27:53.370 --> 00:27:55.003
Come on.

00:27:55.037 --> 00:27:57.237
Come on, we've got to get out of here.

00:28:36.970 --> 00:28:38.437
How is he?

00:28:38.471 --> 00:28:41.103
He just needed a
little rest, that's all.

00:28:41.137 --> 00:28:44.103
How are you?

00:28:44.137 --> 00:28:48.970
[ Inhales deeply ] i'll survive.

00:28:51.103 --> 00:28:54.070
Hey, you don't think we
were followed here, do you?

00:28:54.103 --> 00:28:55.737
I don't know. I don't think so.

00:28:55.771 --> 00:28:56.804
We couldn't have found

00:28:56.838 --> 00:28:58.704
A more out-Of-The-Way
place to hole up.

00:28:58.737 --> 00:29:01.270
Yeah.

00:29:05.270 --> 00:29:06.938
Hey, uh...

00:29:09.571 --> 00:29:11.537
Dean, you, um...

00:29:14.437 --> 00:29:17.404
You saved my life back there.

00:29:17.437 --> 00:29:21.037
So i guess you're glad
i brought the gun, huh?

00:29:21.070 --> 00:29:25.204
Man, i'm trying to thank you here.

00:29:27.437 --> 00:29:29.604
You're welcome.

00:29:40.571 --> 00:29:42.037
Hey, sam?

00:29:42.070 --> 00:29:44.037
Yeah?

00:29:44.070 --> 00:29:47.204
You know that guy i shot?

00:29:47.237 --> 00:29:49.571
There was a person in there.

00:29:54.471 --> 00:29:56.938
You didn't have a choice, dean.

00:29:56.970 --> 00:30:00.270
I know. That's not what bothers me.

00:30:00.304 --> 00:30:03.804
Then what does?

00:30:07.904 --> 00:30:10.571
Killing that guy, killing meg.

00:30:12.571 --> 00:30:15.904
I didn't hesitate. I didn't even flinch.

00:30:18.504 --> 00:30:21.471
For you or dad, the things
i'm willing to do or kill,

00:30:21.504 --> 00:30:23.504
It's just...

00:30:25.838 --> 00:30:28.671
It scares me sometimes.

00:30:35.170 --> 00:30:38.804
It shouldn't.

00:30:38.838 --> 00:30:40.504
You did good.

00:30:40.537 --> 00:30:42.871
You're not mad?

00:30:42.904 --> 00:30:45.471
For what?

00:30:45.504 --> 00:30:47.804
Using a bullet.

00:30:49.604 --> 00:30:53.037
Mad? I'm proud of you.

00:30:54.671 --> 00:30:59.237
You know, sam and i, we
can get pretty obsessed.

00:30:59.270 --> 00:31:04.370
But you
- You watch out for this family.

00:31:04.404 --> 00:31:06.537
You always have.

00:31:12.970 --> 00:31:14.270
Thanks.

00:31:26.237 --> 00:31:29.170
It found us. It's here. The demon?

00:31:29.204 --> 00:31:31.637
Sam, lines of salt in front
of every window, ever door.

00:31:31.671 --> 00:31:32.970
Already did it.

00:31:33.003 --> 00:31:35.437
Check it, okay?

00:31:35.471 --> 00:31:37.771
Dean, you got the gun? Yeah.

00:31:37.804 --> 00:31:39.771
Give it to me. Sam
tried to shoot the demon.

00:31:39.804 --> 00:31:41.604
It vanished.

00:31:41.637 --> 00:31:45.904
I won't miss. Now, the gun. Hurry.

00:31:49.537 --> 00:31:52.070
Son, please.

00:31:58.970 --> 00:32:01.604
Give me the gun. What
are you doing, dean?

00:32:01.637 --> 00:32:03.170
You'd be furious.

00:32:03.204 --> 00:32:04.170
What?

00:32:04.204 --> 00:32:05.571
That i wasted a bullet.

00:32:05.604 --> 00:32:08.571
He wouldn't be proud of
me. He'd tear me a new one.

00:32:15.537 --> 00:32:18.304
You're not my dad.

00:32:21.604 --> 00:32:23.904
I know my dad better than anyone,

00:32:23.937 --> 00:32:25.737
And you ain't him.

00:32:25.770 --> 00:32:27.338
What the hell has gotten into you?

00:32:27.370 --> 00:32:29.503
I could ask you the same thing.

00:32:29.537 --> 00:32:32.670
Dean? What the hell is going on?

00:32:32.704 --> 00:32:34.670
Your brother's lost his mind.

00:32:34.704 --> 00:32:35.837
He's not dad.

00:32:35.871 --> 00:32:37.004
What?

00:32:37.037 --> 00:32:38.238
I think he's possessed.

00:32:38.271 --> 00:32:40.503
I think he's been possessed
since we rescued him.

00:32:40.537 --> 00:32:42.537
Don't listen to him.
Dean, how do you know?

00:32:42.570 --> 00:32:44.037
He's different.

00:32:44.071 --> 00:32:45.271
We don't have time for this.

00:32:45.304 --> 00:32:47.570
Sam, if you want to kill this demon,

00:32:47.604 --> 00:32:49.403
You've got to trust me.

00:32:54.271 --> 00:32:56.370
Sam?

00:33:03.470 --> 00:33:05.137
No.

00:33:07.071 --> 00:33:08.238
No.

00:33:17.904 --> 00:33:19.238
Fine.

00:33:20.971 --> 00:33:26.004
You're both so sure. Go ahead.

00:33:27.470 --> 00:33:30.370
Kill me.

00:33:43.004 --> 00:33:45.670
I thought so.

00:33:58.937 --> 00:34:04.737
What a pain in the
ass this thing's been.

00:34:04.770 --> 00:34:08.403
It's you, isn't it?

00:34:08.437 --> 00:34:11.804
We've been looking for
you for a long time.

00:34:11.837 --> 00:34:13.570
Well, you found me.

00:34:13.604 --> 00:34:15.004
But the holy water?

00:34:15.037 --> 00:34:18.470
You think something like that
works on something like me?

00:34:23.570 --> 00:34:25.204
I'm gonna kill you!

00:34:25.238 --> 00:34:29.204
Oh, that would be a neat trick.

00:34:29.238 --> 00:34:32.370
In fact, here.

00:34:32.403 --> 00:34:36.804
Make the gun float to
you there, psychic boy.

00:34:45.704 --> 00:34:47.370
Well, this is fun.

00:34:47.403 --> 00:34:51.537
I could've killed you a
hundred times today, but this...

00:34:53.804 --> 00:34:55.670
This is worth the wait.

00:34:58.871 --> 00:35:04.737
Your dad
- He's in here with me,

00:35:04.770 --> 00:35:07.071
Trapped inside his own meat suit.

00:35:07.104 --> 00:35:09.470
He says "hi," by the way.

00:35:09.503 --> 00:35:11.604
He's gonna tear you apart.

00:35:14.604 --> 00:35:16.338
He's gonna taste the iron in your blood.

00:35:16.370 --> 00:35:18.503
Let him go, or i swear to god -

00:35:18.537 --> 00:35:23.338
What? What are you and god gonna do?

00:35:23.370 --> 00:35:28.104
You see, as far as i'm
concerned, this is justice.

00:35:32.403 --> 00:35:37.037
You know that little exorcism of yours?

00:35:37.071 --> 00:35:39.937
That was my daughter.

00:35:39.971 --> 00:35:41.271
Who, meg?

00:35:41.304 --> 00:35:42.971
The one in the alley?

00:35:45.071 --> 00:35:47.704
That was my boy.

00:35:47.737 --> 00:35:49.204
You understand?

00:35:49.238 --> 00:35:51.171
You've got to be kidding me.

00:35:51.204 --> 00:35:54.004
What? You're the only one
that can have a family?

00:35:54.037 --> 00:35:57.537
You destroyed my children.

00:35:57.570 --> 00:36:00.304
How would you feel if
i killed your family?

00:36:05.770 --> 00:36:09.238
Oh, that's right.

00:36:09.271 --> 00:36:11.271
I forgot. I did.

00:36:13.570 --> 00:36:18.570
Still, two wrongs don't make a right.

00:36:18.604 --> 00:36:21.071
You son of a bitch.

00:36:21.104 --> 00:36:24.637
I want to know why. Why did you do it?

00:36:24.670 --> 00:36:28.238
You mean why did i kill
mommy and pretty, little jess?

00:36:28.271 --> 00:36:29.437
Yeah.

00:36:29.470 --> 00:36:32.604
You know, i never told you this,

00:36:32.637 --> 00:36:35.971
But sam was gonna ask her to marry him.

00:36:36.004 --> 00:36:39.804
Been shopping for rings and everything.

00:36:39.837 --> 00:36:43.004
You want to know why?

00:36:43.037 --> 00:36:45.171
Because they got in the way.

00:36:45.204 --> 00:36:46.737
In the way of what?

00:36:46.770 --> 00:36:48.238
My plans for you, sammy -

00:36:48.271 --> 00:36:52.670
You...and all the children like you.

00:36:52.704 --> 00:36:56.338
Listen, you mind just
getting this over with, huh?

00:36:56.370 --> 00:36:59.004
'Cause i really can't
stand the monologuing.

00:36:59.037 --> 00:37:02.503
Funny, but that's all part
of your m.O., isn't it?

00:37:02.537 --> 00:37:06.904
Mask all that nasty
pain, mask the truth.

00:37:06.937 --> 00:37:09.104
Oh, yeah? What's that?

00:37:09.137 --> 00:37:11.437
You know, you fight, and
you fight for this family,

00:37:11.470 --> 00:37:16.670
But the truth is they don't need you.

00:37:16.704 --> 00:37:18.971
Not like you need them.

00:37:21.004 --> 00:37:25.037
Sam
- He's clearly john's favorite.

00:37:25.071 --> 00:37:27.604
Even when they fight,

00:37:27.637 --> 00:37:30.904
It's more concern than
he's ever shown you.

00:37:33.037 --> 00:37:37.004
I bet you're real proud
of your kids, too, huh?

00:37:37.037 --> 00:37:41.837
Oh, wait, i forgot. I wasted 'em.

00:37:55.537 --> 00:37:56.971
Aah!

00:37:57.004 --> 00:37:59.537
Dean!

00:37:59.570 --> 00:38:01.204
No!

00:38:08.171 --> 00:38:10.704
Dad!

00:38:10.737 --> 00:38:13.770
Dad, don't you let it kill me!

00:38:15.370 --> 00:38:17.004
Dean!

00:38:30.470 --> 00:38:32.604
Dad, please.

00:38:40.470 --> 00:38:41.904
Dean!

00:38:44.104 --> 00:38:46.837
No! Stop.

00:38:48.604 --> 00:38:50.437
Stop it.

00:38:58.238 --> 00:39:02.104
You kill me, you kill daddy.

00:39:02.137 --> 00:39:03.737
I know.

00:39:14.171 --> 00:39:17.137
Dean? Dean? Hey.

00:39:17.171 --> 00:39:18.637
Oh, god, you lost a lot of blood.

00:39:18.670 --> 00:39:20.804
Where's dad?

00:39:20.837 --> 00:39:22.937
He's right here. He's right here, dean.

00:39:22.971 --> 00:39:27.437
Go check on him.

00:39:35.637 --> 00:39:39.770
Dad?

00:39:39.804 --> 00:39:42.104
Sammy!

00:39:42.137 --> 00:39:45.837
It's still alive. It's
inside me. I can feel it.

00:39:45.871 --> 00:39:47.004
You shoot me.

00:39:47.037 --> 00:39:50.503
You shoot me! You shoot
me in the heart, son!

00:39:50.537 --> 00:39:53.071
Do it, now!

00:39:53.104 --> 00:39:54.904
Sam, don't you do it. Don't you do it.

00:39:54.937 --> 00:39:56.338
You've got to hurry.

00:39:56.370 --> 00:39:58.271
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:39:58.304 --> 00:40:01.437
You shoot me, son! Shoot me!

00:40:01.470 --> 00:40:04.670
Son, i'm begging you! We
can end this here and now!

00:40:05.837 --> 00:40:08.470
Sammy, you kill me!

00:40:08.503 --> 00:40:09.637
Sam, no.

00:40:09.670 --> 00:40:12.370
You do this!

00:40:12.403 --> 00:40:14.937
Sammy!

00:40:14.971 --> 00:40:18.304
Sam, sam...

00:40:22.338 --> 00:40:24.271
I'm begging you, son. You've got to.

00:40:24.304 --> 00:40:27.338
I can't hold on to it much longer.

00:40:27.370 --> 00:40:29.238
Shoot me!

00:40:55.204 --> 00:40:58.671
Look, just hold on, all right?

00:40:58.704 --> 00:41:02.037
The hospital is only 10 minutes away.

00:41:02.070 --> 00:41:05.804
I'm surprised at you, sammy.
Why didn't you kill it?

00:41:05.838 --> 00:41:08.137
I thought we saw
eye-To-Eye on this.

00:41:08.170 --> 00:41:09.704
Killing this demon comes first -

00:41:09.737 --> 00:41:12.404
Before me, before everything.

00:41:14.970 --> 00:41:18.871
No, sir, not before everything.

00:41:18.904 --> 00:41:22.070
Look, we've still got the colt.

00:41:22.103 --> 00:41:23.737
We still have the one bullet left.

00:41:23.771 --> 00:41:25.571
We just have to start over, all right?

00:41:25.604 --> 00:41:26.938
We already found the demon -



00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.000
